                                "sense_id": "4f8c2732-0fa9-32bf-8eb4-259c8aacd366",
                                "text": "The act of preparing a wick to vape, usually done by adding a few drops and soaking the wick in e-juice or taking a few pulls without heating the coil. This is not relevant for drippers/drip-style atomizers."
                            },
                            {
