                                "sense_id": "4f8c2732-0fa9-32bf-8eb4-259c8aacd366",
                                "text": "However, there are actually two ways of delivering the tasty flavoring (and nicotine, if you’re into that) into your mouth using an atomizing method; you could use a tank, or you could use a dripper."
